//===== rAthena Script =======================================
//= Edda Half Moon In The Daylight
//===== Description: =========================================
//= [Walkthrough Conversion]
//= Episode 16.1 - Edda Half Moon In The Daylight
//===== Changelog: ===========================================
//= 1.0 Initial Release [Everade]
//= 1.1 Clean-up [Capuche]
